  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nGiven: 43 D 15 C 7 B 9 D (28 A 2) = ?\n\n43 D 15 C 7 B 9 D (28 A 2) = ? ⇒ 43 - 15 + 7 × 9 - (28 ÷ 2) = ?\n\n⇒ 43 - 15 + 7 × 9 - __**(28 **____**÷**____** 2)**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 43 - 15 + __**7 **____**×**____** 9**__ - 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**43 + 63**__ - 15 - 14 = ?\n\n⇒ __**106 - 15**____** - 14**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 77 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
